      "text": "```\nANIMAL KINGDOM IN THE TREE OF LIFE\n====================================="
    },
    {
      "id": "00-OVERVIEW.md#004",
      "path": [
        "00-OVERVIEW.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:zoology:00-overview, git-history:zoology:00-overview]",
        "canonical_path": "zoology/00-OVERVIEW.md",
        "concepts": "[overview]",
        "current_path": "zoology/00-OVERVIEW.md",
        "id": "maxim:zoology:overview",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "zoology",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[overview]",
        "section": "zoology",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Zoology - Landscape and Taxonomy",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "EUKARYOTA\n|\n+-- PLANTAE (photosynthetic; cell walls)\n+-- FUNGI (absorptive; cell walls; chitin)\n+-- PROTISTA (paraphyletic; diverse)\n+-- ANIMALIA (~1.5 million described spp)\n    |\n    +-- PARAZOA (no true tissues)\n    |   +-- Porifera (sponges: ~10,000 spp)\n    |   +-- Placozoa (~3 spp; simplest animals)\n    |\n    +-- EUMETAZOA (true tissues)\n        |\n        +-- RADIATA (radial symmetry)\n        |   +-- Cnidaria (jellyfish, corals: ~10,000 spp)\n        |   +-- Ctenophora (comb jellies: ~100 spp)\n        |\n        +-- BILATERIA (bilateral symmetry; ~99% of animals)\n            |\n            +-- PROTOSTOMIA\n            |   +-- Lophotrochozoa\n            |   |   +-- Mollusca (~100,000 spp)\n            |   |   +-- Annelida (~22,000 spp)\n            |   |   +-- Platyhelminthes (~20,000 spp)\n            |   |   +-- Brachiopoda, Bryozoa, Phoronida\n            |   |\n            |   +-- Ecdysozoa\n            |       +-- Arthropoda (~1,000,000 spp) <- LARGEST PHYLUM\n            |       +-- Nematoda (~25,000 spp described; ~1M estimated)\n            |       +-- Tardigrada, Priapulida, others\n            |\n            +-- DEUTEROSTOMIA\n                +-- Echinodermata (~7,000 spp)\n                +-- Hemichordata (~120 spp)\n                +-- CHORDATA (~65,000 spp)\n                    +-- Urochordata (tunicates)\n                    +-- Cephalochordata (lancelets)\n                    +-- VERTEBRATA (~58,000 spp)\n```"
    },
