        "section": "zoology",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Zoology - Landscape and Taxonomy",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "REQUIRED:\n  1. Eukaryotic (membrane-bound nuclei)\n  2. Multicellular (no single-celled animals)\n  3. Heterotrophic (cannot fix own carbon; must ingest)\n  4. No cell walls (vs plants + fungi)\n  5. Most: motile at some life stage\n  6. Most: sexual reproduction (haploid gametes fusing -> diploid)\n  7. Most: embryonic development through blastula stage"
    },
    {
      "id": "00-OVERVIEW.md#009",
      "path": [
        "00-OVERVIEW.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:zoology:00-overview, git-history:zoology:00-overview]",
