        "root_concepts": "[overview]",
        "section": "zoology",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Zoology - Landscape and Taxonomy",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "DERIVED CHARACTERS (not universal):\n  Nervous system (absent in Porifera, Placozoa)\n  Muscles (absent in Porifera)\n  Bilateral symmetry (absent in Porifera, Cnidaria, many Echinodermata)\n  Coelom (absent or modified in many)\n  Segmentation (present in Annelida, Arthropoda, Chordata; convergent)\n```"
    },
