      "text": "INVERTEBRATES (~95% of all animal species):\n+-------------------+----------+----------------------------+\n| Phylum            | Spp      | Representatives            |\n+-------------------+----------+----------------------------+\n| Arthropoda        | ~1,000K  | Insects, crustaceans,      |\n|                   |          | spiders, mites             |\n| Nematoda          | ~25K desc | Roundworms, C. elegans     |\n|                   | (~1M est)|                            |\n| Mollusca          | ~100K    | Snails, clams, octopus     |\n| Platyhelminthes   | ~20K     | Tapeworms, flukes,         |\n|                   |          | planarians                 |\n| Annelida          | ~22K     | Earthworms, leeches,       |\n|                   |          | polychaetes                |\n| Cnidaria          | ~10K     | Jellyfish, corals, anemones|\n| Echinodermata     | ~7K      | Starfish, sea urchins,     |\n|                   |          | sea cucumbers              |\n| Porifera          | ~10K     | Sponges                    |\n+-------------------+----------+----------------------------+"
