      "text": "```\nZOOLOGY SUBDISCIPLINES\n========================\n+-------------------+------------------------------------------+\n| Comparative morph | Body plans, symmetry, organ homology     |\n| Physiology        | Organ systems, homeostasis               |\n| Developmental bio | Embryology, evo-devo, Hox genes          |\n| Ethology          | Behavior: mechanisms + function          |\n| Behavioral ecol.  | Foraging, mating, altruism               |\n| Ecology           | Populations, communities, ecosystems     |\n| Systematics       | Taxonomy, phylogenetics                  |\n| Evolutionary bio  | Speciation, adaptation, macroevolution   |\n| Parasitology      | Host-parasite interactions               |\n| Conservation      | Species + habitat protection             |\n+-------------------+------------------------------------------+\n```"
