        "root_concepts": "[overview]",
        "section": "zoology",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Zoology - Landscape and Taxonomy",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "SUPERCLASS PISCES (fish; paraphyletic):\n  Agnatha (jawless): lampreys, hagfish (~120 spp)\n  Chondrichthyes: cartilaginous fish (~1,100 spp)\n    Sharks, rays, skates, chimaeras\n  Osteichthyes (bony fish):\n    Actinopterygii (ray-finned): ~33,000 spp (largest vertebrate class)\n    Sarcopterygii (lobe-finned): ~8 species (coelacanths + lungfish)\n      + all tetrapods evolved from this group"
    },
    {
      "id": "00-OVERVIEW.md#028",
      "path": [
        "00-OVERVIEW.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:zoology:00-overview, git-history:zoology:00-overview]",
